// Reconciler ka contract, ek line mein:
//
//   reconcile(parentDom, oldElement, newElement, index)
//
// Chaar cases, aur bas chaar:
//
//   old = null,  new = kuch   ->  ADD      (naya DOM banao, append)
//   old = kuch,  new = null   ->  REMOVE   (removeChild)
//   old.type !== new.type     ->  REPLACE  (poora subtree naya)
//   old.type === new.type     ->  UPDATE   (props update, children recurse)
